msgctxt "104"
msgid "Phew... hah... Check it out, boss. I snagged a real pricey one today."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "116"
msgid "Nice work, little man. Now we can⑬ Hey! Who the hell are you!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "128"
msgid "I came to take back what's mine."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "140"
msgid ""
"What the shit, little man! I trust you with the business, and you bring "
"back this big fuck!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "152"
msgid "He must've followed me, man! I thought I lost him!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "164"
msgid "I might be getting old, but you can't lose me that easy."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "176"
msgid ""
"Un-fucking-believable! How many times have I told you to take the long "
"route when somebody's chasin' you!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "188"
msgid "So you're the head of this little \"syndicate\"?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "200"
msgid "Heh... damn right. Hostesses go nuts over those bags they sell."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "212"
msgid ""
"We give the hos what they want, and they give us what we need! Player's "
"life, baby!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "224"
msgid "<Italic>Bam</Italic>! You said it, bro! We get all the hos we want!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "236"
msgid "Punks like you make me sick."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "248"
msgid "Too bad you had to walk in on us. Now you're gonna die in this alley!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "272"
msgid "Dammit..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "284"
msgid "Argh... The player's life..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "296"
msgid "Still haven't learned your lesson?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "308"
msgid "No, we have! Please! Take this! We don't need it no more!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "332"
msgid "You reclaimed your <Color:8>Italian Shoulder Bag<Color:Default>."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "380"
msgid "You reclaimed your <Color:8>French Handbag<Color:Default>."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "428"
msgid "You reclaimed your <Color:8>Monogrammed Bag<Color:Default>."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "476"
msgid "You reclaimed your <Color:8>Caviar Skin Bag<Color:Default>."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "512"
msgid "And... and take this, too! Just please... don't hit us no more!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "524"
msgid "You got a <Color:8>Caviar Skin Bag<Color:Default>."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "548"
msgid "It's an expensive designer bag. We all pitched in..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "560"
msgid "We were gonna use it to get the hottest chicks at the club..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "572"
msgid ""
"Clean up your acts. If you want the attention of good women, start by "
"acting like good men."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "596"
msgid "You got 3,000 EXP."
msgstr ""

